scenario room lights switched on and left on with nobody there: budget unchanged (TP15)
room 0
boot
within 9 state == DARK_IDLE
remember remaining
room 20 white
within 1.0 state == YIELD
expect level == 0
wait 29
expect pending > 0             # held aside while it might still be another light
within 1.5 state == DARK_IDLE  # 30 s: a scene change, the room is the room again
expect scene_changes == 1
expect remaining == @remaining # nothing was charged for the room's own light
expect event_fmm == 0
expect pending == 0
